    "title": "Millstadt residents asked to cut back on water use after fire - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By First Alert 4 Staff ,\n1 days ago MILLSTADT, Ill. (First Alert 4) - A water treatment plant caught fire in Millstadt on Tuesday afternoon. According to the Millstadt Ambulance Service, the fire broke out at the Village of Millstadt Wastewater Treatment Facility on E. Laurel before 4:30 p.m. Residents were asked to stay clear of the area while first responders work to put out the flames. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
